# === Secrets / environment ===
# Wildcard (not just ".env") so this also catches stray variants like a
# trailing-space filename from an editor's "new file" dialog, ".env.local", etc.
.env*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
serviceAccountKey.json
service-account*.json

# === Dependencies ===
node_modules

